{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 4, "text": "针治在布依族医学中运用较为广泛。布依族妇女不仅懂得诊断小儿各种疾病，而且", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 366, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "针治在布依族医学中运用较为广泛。布依族妇女不仅懂得诊断小儿各种疾病，而且", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 366, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 5, "text": "还掌握针挑剔经脉而治愈疳疾。她们常称疳疾为“年毛”，医治时，先检查病人的背上是", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 426, "w": 1548, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "还掌握针挑剔经脉而治愈疳疾。她们常称疳疾为“年毛”，医治时，先检查病人的背上是", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 426, "w": 1548, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 6, "text": "否有疳疾诊状，如有背上皮肤必显“痣黑点”，她们就用针挑剔黑点处，挑出如羊毛一样细", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 491, "w": 1540, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "否有疳疾诊状，如有背上皮肤必显“痣黑点”，她们就用针挑剔黑点处，挑出如羊毛一样细", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 491, "w": 1540, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 7, "text": "丝，这种丝毛连绵不断，有时大针可挑断，挑完后，病人周身筋骨舒适，饮食剧增，疳疾根", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 559, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "丝，这种丝毛连绵不断，有时大针可挑断，挑完后，病人周身筋骨舒适，饮食剧增，疳疾根", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 559, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 8, "text": "除，身体恢复如故。宋代范成大《桂海虞衡志》亦云：“寒热阶段，南吏卒小民，使人以小锥", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 624, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "除，身体恢复如故。宋代范成大《桂海虞衡志》亦云：“寒热阶段，南吏卒小民，使人以小锥", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 624, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 9, "text": "刺•⋯谓之挑草子。”此外，平时刺物刺人体（手足），用针把它挑出来；若生脓包，也用针", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 692, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "刺•⋯谓之挑草子。”此外，平时刺物刺人体（手足），用针把它挑出来；若生脓包，也用针", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 692, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 10, "text": "尖挑起患处，将脓水挤出来。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 760, "w": 494, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "尖挑起患处，将脓水挤出来。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 760, "w": 494, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 11, "text": "（八）饮食法", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 823, "w": 222, "h": 47}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（八）饮食法", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 823, "w": 222, "h": 47}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 12, "text": "布依族医学上的“饮食法”是将药物给病人口服或配以饭菜吃下以达到疗效的一种", "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 881, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族医学上的“饮食法”是将药物给病人口服或配以饭菜吃下以达到疗效的一种", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 881, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 13, "text": "治病方法。此法对各种疾病特别是内科病的运用最为广泛，如痢疾用此法很有效，或以", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 949, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "治病方法。此法对各种疾病特别是内科病的运用最为广泛，如痢疾用此法很有效，或以", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 949, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 14, "text": "枫香叶捣烂喝其水；或在饮水里酒些石灰后饮用；或饮用“苦丁茶”水；或用木耳掺酒醋炒", "bbox_px": {"x": 116, "y": 1002, "w": 1549, "h": 77}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "枫香叶捣烂喝其水；或在饮水里酒些石灰后饮用；或饮用“苦丁茶”水；或用木耳掺酒醋炒", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 116, "y": 1002, "w": 1549, "h": 77}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 15, "text": "来当菜吃；或以苦瓜苦菜“青寒”（布依语）及狗矢藤和糯米面煎粑粑吃也有效。", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1074, "w": 1367, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "来当菜吃；或以苦瓜苦菜“青寒”（布依语）及狗矢藤和糯米面煎粑粑吃也有效。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1074, "w": 1367, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 16, "text": "（九）炸灯火", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1149, "w": 222, "h": 43}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（九）炸灯火", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1149, "w": 222, "h": 43}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 17, "text": "炸灯火是用灯芯草蘸上桐油将其点燃，然后根据需要在体表一定的部位或穴位上快", "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 1207, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "炸灯火是用灯芯草蘸上桐油将其点燃，然后根据需要在体表一定的部位或穴位上快", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 1207, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 18, "text": "速烧灼直到局部皮肤出现点状焦痂为止。此法一般用于治疗小儿痄腮、咳喘、食滞、泄泻", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1271, "w": 1548, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "速烧灼直到局部皮肤出现点状焦痂为止。此法一般用于治疗小儿痄腮、咳喘、食滞、泄泻", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1271, "w": 1548, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 19, "text": "等，施治方便，具有疗效。", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1336, "w": 434, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "等，施治方便，具有疗效。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1336, "w": 434, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 20, "text": "（十）几种特殊医疗技术", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1408, "w": 434, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（十）几种特殊医疗技术", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1408, "w": 434, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 21, "text": "1. 治“不育症”。布依族草药可治“不育症”。布依族民间医生常常以猴结（猴子的", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1468, "w": 1463, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "1. 治“不育症”。布依族草药可治“不育症”。布依族民间医生常常以猴结（猴子的", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1468, "w": 1463, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 22, "text": "月经）为主配成药方治疗妇女不育；男不育，以杜仲为主药，配以狗肾等单方药物。", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1537, "w": 1411, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "月经）为主配成药方治疗妇女不育；男不育，以杜仲为主药，配以狗肾等单方药物。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1537, "w": 1411, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 23, "text": "2. 接骨。布依族医学上的接骨不需要复杂的设备和手术即可矫正治愈骨折，兴义县", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1601, "w": 1463, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "2. 接骨。布依族医学上的接骨不需要复杂的设备和手术即可矫正治愈骨折，兴义县", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1601, "w": 1463, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 24, "text": "有一例掌骨破碎、皮肉脱落的病者，请一位布依族老太太医治，能使碎骨愈合、肌肉复生、", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1666, "w": 1548, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "有一例掌骨破碎、皮肉脱落的病者，请一位布依族老太太医治，能使碎骨愈合、肌肉复生、", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1666, "w": 1548, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 25, "text": "正常劳动；关岭县有位妇女跌下高岩，四肢大骨和肋骨全折断，请一位姓马的布依族老人", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1730, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "正常劳动；关岭县有位妇女跌下高岩，四肢大骨和肋骨全折断，请一位姓马的布依族老人", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1730, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 26, "text": "治疗，两月痊愈；册亨县冗渡一位布依族医生，以祖传秘方基础，加上自己多年从医的", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1790, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "治疗，两月痊愈；册亨县冗渡一位布依族医生，以祖传秘方基础，加上自己多年从医的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1790, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 27, "text": "经验，简化配方，改革剂型，配制成骨粉药膏“介骨灵”", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1851, "w": 937, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "经验，简化配方，改革剂型，配制成骨粉药膏“介骨灵”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1851, "w": 937, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 28, "text": "’，对骨折消肿、止痛，促进愈合有较", "bbox_px": {"x": 1041, "y": 1855, "w": 627, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "’，对骨折消肿、止痛，促进愈合有较", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 1041, "y": 1855, "w": 627, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 29, "text": "好的疗效。", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1923, "w": 185, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "好的疗效。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1923, "w": 185, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 30, "text": "3. 制毒药与解毒药。康熙《贵州通志•蛮僚》记载：布依“俭百物之毒以染箭，中人", "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 1983, "w": 1471, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "3. 制毒药与解毒药。康熙《贵州通志•蛮僚》记载：布依“俭百物之毒以染箭，中人", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 1983, "w": 1471, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 323, "line_no": 31, "text": "血濡缕立死”。布依族的制毒方法是用红辣子直接挂在马蜂窝边，使群蜂误为是人或火，", "bbox_px": {"x": 120, "y": 2042, "w": 1548, "h": 70}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "血濡缕立死”。布依族的制毒方法是用红辣子直接挂在马蜂窝边，使群蜂误为是人或火，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 120, "y": 2042, "w": 1548, "h": 70}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
